 its freshness reason and the revisions it was taken against one click away.","interactionRules":["The title names the View and the render context the capture recorded (Variant or Base state, viewport and size, Locale, theme); the capture shows fitted to the dialog, or at its actual size in a scrolling area.","A stale capture says so with the reason for the first freshness Rule it fails: the View, a Locale, a viewport size or removal, a theme, the Adapters or the Product Kit changed since capture.","A capture whose provenance cannot be judged says its freshness is unknown, which counts as not fresh; Capture again offers a fresh run of exactly that context and appears only for a capture that is not fresh and only to a holder of evidence.capture.","Show in canvas applies the recorded context to the Workbench canvas; Details shows the Evidence identifier, the View and Locale revisions the capture recorded and the UIUX version."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"e9f5d101-3a1b-4c2d-9e4f-6b7c8d9eaf01"}],"requirements":["01a115cd-c49d-7c39-87ed-7098ed135e5f","01a1161b-ff68-76af-8237-dbc8ef2c27d1","01a115cd-c5a5-757a-b049-b5138fe75920"]},"variants":{"actual-size":{"state":{"actual-size":{"visible":false},"fit":{"visible":true},"shot-actual":{"visible":true},"shot-fit":{"visible":false}}},"details-open":{"requirements":["01a115cd-c49d-7c39-87ed-7098ed135e5f"],"state":{"details":{"open":true}}},"no-capture-key":{"requirements":["01a11485-eba3-7c07-a94f-0d69e610a0b6"],"state":{"alert-view-changed":{"visible":true}}},"stale-adapter-changed":{"requirements":["01a115cd-c6de-7744-be27-715bec2e7fef"],"state":{"alert-adapter-changed":{"visible":true},"capture-again":{"visible":true}}},"stale-incomplete":{"state":{"alert-incomplete":{"visible":true},"capt